 have a look at that


Taking the four of them together rather than one after another.

Let me get the shape of this first.

ls 7L
find **/*.go 2L
find **/*.toml 1L
grep package *.go 2L
Three searches, all at once.

Now to find where the drawing happens.

grep spinner *.go 1L
grep footer *.go 1L
grep cursor *.go 1L

One more pair, and one of them will not be there.

ls 7L
read nowhere/at/all.go ✗ 1L nowhere/at/all.go: no such file or directory

That is the lot: four together, then three together, then a pair where only one of them could be
answered.
